        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-187479-187676"><seg source="#source-187479-187491">先つ頃</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-187491-187518"><rb>如水</rb><rt>じょすい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-187518-187551">氏などの連中寄合ひて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-187551-187578"><rb>袴能</rb><rt>はかまのう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-187578-187617">を催しけるとかや。素顔に笠</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-187617-187632"><rb>着</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-187632-187676">たる姿など話に聞くもゆかしく</seg></p>
